  "changed_since_previous": "Added release notes and updated `TransactionDescriptionString` to optionally omit `parent_descs` when called by `listrawtransactions`, alongside minor docstring corrections for replacement txids.",
  "card": "Adds a new listrawtransactions wallet RPC that returns all wallet transactions without category interpretation or change suppression. Currently, listtransactions hides consolidations and self-transfers because it only reports transactions with an external send or receive category, leaving wallet activity invisible as reported in issue #34632. The RPC returns each transaction once with its net balance change, fee, hex, and an optional decoded transaction structure, supporting count and skip pagination. This addresses the gap identified in issue #34632 following prior discussion on PR #35009.",
